---
import FutureLayout from '../layouts/FutureLayout.astro';
---
<FutureLayout title="Guided Estimate | East Coast Foam" description="Explore an East Coast Foam estimate request by sharing the project, property, timing, optional photos or plans, and contact preferences." estimatePage>
  <section class="future-v1__guided-estimate" aria-labelledby="estimate-title">
    <header class="future-v1__guided-estimate-intro">
      <p class="future-v1__kicker">Request an estimate</p>
      <h1 id="estimate-title">Tell us about the project.</h1>
      <p>Call or email East Coast Foam to discuss your project and request an estimate.</p>
      <p>Online requests are temporarily unavailable. Please contact us directly so your request reaches our team.</p>
      <p><a class="future-v1__button" href="tel:+18432634933">Call (843) 263-4933</a></p>
      <p><a href="mailto:ecfoam@outlook.com?subject=Estimate%20request">Email ecfoam@outlook.com</a></p>
      <p>Include your name, phone number, project location, service needed, and preferred timing. You can attach photos or plans to your email.</p>
    </header>
  </section>
</FutureLayout>
